Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Random Forest Prediction of RNA m6A Modification Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ruiqing", "Liu", email = "Ruiqing.Liu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable functions for predicting N6-methyladenosine (m6A)
    RNA modification sites from sequence and annotation features using a fitted
    random forest classifier. The package supports both multiple-sample and
    single-sample prediction and includes an example input dataset and fitted model.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0),
    randomForest
Suggests:
    devtools,
    remotes
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
